T1  - From trust to augmentation: A comprehensive survey on synergistic integration of decentralized and generative intelligence
AU  - Karim, Md Monjurul
AU  - Khan, Sangeen
AU  - Qu, Qiang
AU  - Muzammal, Muhammad
AU  - Sharif, Kashif
AU  - Biswas, Sujit
JO  - Computer Science Review
