T1  - Benchmarking the effectiveness of multi-agent LLMs in collaborative privacy threat modeling with LINDDUN GO
AU  - Bissoli, Andrea
AU  - Mollaeefar, Majid
AU  - Van Landuyt, Dimitri
AU  - Ranise, Silvio
JO  - Journal of Information Security and Applications
